---
interface Props {
  isEs?: boolean;
}

const { isEs = false } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="our-company" class="w-full bg-[#FFFDF9] py-20 md:py-28 scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 md:mb-20">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#E30066] font-bold mb-3">
        {isEs ? "Sobre Incoltec" : "About Incoltec"}
      </span>
      <h2 class="script-text text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl text-[#89385C] mb-6 leading-tight">
        {isEs ? "Nuestra Empresa" : "Our Company"}
      </h2>
      <div class="w-24 h-[1.5px] bg-[#C6ACB8] mx-auto mb-6"></div>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 font-light leading-relaxed">
        {isEs 
          ? "Proximidad, conocimiento local y adaptación. La explosión cromática de nuestras formulaciones simboliza la diversidad de sabores, ingredientes y tradiciones que enriquecen la industria alimentaria mundial."
          : "Proximity, local knowledge, and adaptation. The chromatic explosion of our formulations symbolizes the diversity of flavors, ingredients, and traditions enriching the global food industry."}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sub-anchor: Organización -->
    <div id="organizacion" class="scroll-mt-28 mb-20">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
        <div class="w-8 h-1 bg-[#FFC000] rounded-full"></div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-[#1E1E1E]">
          {isEs ? "Organización y Pilares Estratégicos" : "Organization & Strategic Pillars"}
        </h3>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Pillars Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#E30066]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#E30066] mb-5 font-bold text-xl">
            01
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#E30066] mb-3">
            {isEs ? "Solidez Corporativa" : "Corporate Solidity"}
          </h4>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-light leading-relaxed">
            {isEs
              ? "Construimos relaciones duraderas basadas en la confianza, cumplimiento riguroso de normativas y trazabilidad completa de cada suministro."
              : "We build long-term relationships based on trust, strict compliance with global food standards, and complete supply traceability."}
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#FFC000]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#FFC000] mb-5 font-bold text-xl">
            02
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#FFC000] mb-3">
            {isEs ? "Liderazgo Industrial" : "Industrial Leadership"}
          </h4>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-light leading-relaxed">
            {isEs
              ? "Marcamos la pauta en el desarrollo de soluciones cromáticas avanzadas para productores de alimentos de gran escala y mercados exigentes."
              : "We set the standard in developing advanced chromatic solutions for large-scale food processors and demanding markets."}
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#008AD8]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#008AD8] mb-5 font-bold text-xl">
            03
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#008AD8] mb-3">
            {isEs ? "Innovación Continua" : "Continuous Innovation"}
          </h4>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-light leading-relaxed">
            {isEs
              ? "Nuestra filosofía 'Vibrant Technology' nos impulsa a buscar siempre la mejora constante en estabilidad, brillo y biodisponibilidad."
              : "Our 'Vibrant Technology' philosophy drives us to continually enhance color stability, brilliance, and bioavailability."}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats Bar -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm border border-[#89385C]/10 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center">
        <div>
          <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-light text-[#89385C] mb-1">
            20<span class="font-bold text-[#FFC000]">+</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">
            {isEs ? "Años de Experiencia" : "Years of Experience"}
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-light text-[#89385C] mb-1">
            100<span class="font-bold text-[#E30066]">%</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">
            {isEs ? "Opciones Naturales" : "Natural Options"}
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-light text-[#89385C] mb-1">
            50<span class="font-bold text-[#008AD8]">+</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">
            {isEs ? "Mercados Globales" : "Global Markets"}
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-light text-[#89385C] mb-1">
            10<span class="font-bold text-[#89385C]">K+</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">
            {isEs ? "Clientes Satisfechos" : "Happy Clients"}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sub-anchor: Laboratorio -->
    <div id="laboratorio" class="scroll-mt-28 bg-[#FAF8F5] p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 rounded-3xl border border-[#EDE8E0]">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
        <div class="md:col-span-7">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-1 bg-[#008AD8] rounded-full"></div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#008AD8] font-bold">
              {isEs ? "Investigación & Desarrollo" : "Research & Development"}
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-[#1E1E1E] mb-6 leading-tight">
            {isEs ? "Laboratorio y Producción Avanzada" : "Advanced Laboratory & Production"}
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-base sm:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
            {isEs
              ? "En nuestro centro de I+D formulamos colorantes líquidos, en pasta, en polvo y en gel, adaptados específicamente a la matriz físico-química de su producto final. Evaluamos resistencia a tratamientos térmicos, pH, foto-estabilidad y vida útil."
              : "In our R&D center, we formulate liquid, paste, powder, and gel colorings tailored specifically to the physicochemical matrix of your food product. We test resistance to heat processing, pH variance, photostability, and shelf life."}
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <span class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
              {isEs ? "Colorantes Líquidos & en Pasta" : "Liquid & Paste Colors"}
            </span>
            <span class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
              {isEs ? "Polvo & Geles de Precisión" : "Powder & Precision Gels"}
            </span>
            <span class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
              {isEs ? "Ensayos de Estabilidad a Medida" : "Custom Stability Testing"}
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="md:col-span-5 relative">
          <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl aspect-4/3">
            <img 
              src="/assets/food-colors-application.webp" 
              alt={isEs ? "Laboratorio Incoltec" : "Incoltec Laboratory"} 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-white text-sm font-light">
              {isEs ? "Control analítico y cromático por espectrofotometría" : "Spectrophotometric chromatic & analytical quality control"}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
